'''Revival of Origin''' is the final stage of the [[Uncanny Legends]] campaign, and the only stage in [[Sacred Forest]]. [[Zero Luza]] and the [[Origin Base (Enemy Base)|Origin Base]] debut here. This is a [[No Continues]] stage. Upon completion, [[Ancient Egg: N000 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N000]] is unlocked, and [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]] can have their level caps increased up to level 50 using [[Catseye]]s.

After clearing all other Uncanny Legends sub-chapters on all Crown difficulties, the 4-Crown version of this stage will be unlocked. On completion, the stage is invaded by [[Sage of Life Dr. Nova]] and becomes the [[Revival of Origin/Invasion|Revival of Origin Invasion]], which reverts to normal when beaten.

